{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/dc4b9aae3d6296eea5d5def6c508bf37.avif?t=1767630306\" width=943 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A<strong> roguelite puzzle</strong> in which you have to lick postage stamps of different shapes and sizes and glue them onto parcels to collect points and teleport the parcels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/c0879943cb32bdb3c46644809c9a47cf.poster.avif?t=1767630306\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/c0879943cb32bdb3c46644809c9a47cf.webm?t=1767630306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/c0879943cb32bdb3c46644809c9a47cf.mp4?t=1767630306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a novice postman, and by order of the Royal Postal Academy, you must<strong> restore an abandoned post office</strong>. You will be assisted by the inhabitants of the place\u2014the cutest little roach-workers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc8c Roach-workers\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire cute little workers and get rewards!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose who goes to work and who gets time off, <strong>collect chosen triplets</strong> and fire your workers that aren\u2019t fit for the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/a620f8665aa62555ff6436e13bf2d12f.poster.avif?t=1767630306\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/a620f8665aa62555ff6436e13bf2d12f.webm?t=1767630306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/a620f8665aa62555ff6436e13bf2d12f.mp4?t=1767630306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc8c Welcome customers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose who gets priority and keep an eye on the <strong>timers</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will receive customer <strong>requests</strong> that make each parcel unique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/4414f1252f4f1f8f23ac209c40b7ee99.avif?t=1767630306\" width=1560 height=589 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to your first shift!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc8c Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polyomino postage stamps and parcel teleportation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colour synergies and conflicts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roach-workers: stars, hobby synergies, flexible staff rotation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Department growth and rare workers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clients with timers and requests, Inspectors\u2019 checks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rating that must be maintained and restored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choice of starter kit and difficulty level before each shift.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/cfdae7c4f1b545667d3d47ec2abeb666.poster.avif?t=1767630306\" width=528 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/cfdae7c4f1b545667d3d47ec2abeb666.webm?t=1767630306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/cfdae7c4f1b545667d3d47ec2abeb666.mp4?t=1767630306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3514630?t=1767630306","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3514630?t=1767630306","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/0db8f5832723e9923803406727b1bcac17c9ed50/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767630306","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/0db8f5832723e9923803406727b1bcac17c9ed50/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767630306","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3762590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/dc4b9aae3d6296eea5d5def6c508bf37.avif?t=1767630306\" width=943 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A<strong> roguelite puzzle</strong> in which you have to lick postage stamps of different shapes and sizes and glue them onto parcels to collect points and teleport the parcels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb